      <method name="set_comments" c:identifier="adw_about_dialog_set_comments" glib:set-property="comments" version="1.5">
        <doc xml:space="preserve" filename="src/adw-about-dialog.c" line="2619">
          Sets the comments about the application.

Comments will be shown on the Details page, above links.

Unlike [property@Gtk.AboutDialog:comments], this string can be long and
detailed. It can also contain links and Pango markup.
        </doc>
